{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45689","headline":"偶作五首 四 · 贯休","name":"偶作五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君子食即食，何必在珍华。\n小人食不食，纵食如泥沙。\n清歌且莫唱，妙舞亦休夸。\n尔非凤灸麒麟肉，焉能一挂於齿牙。\n去来去来归去来，红泉正洒芙蓉霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}